p/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F54149%2F54149.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】海の湯宿　花しぶき の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">💡 千葉・ディズニー・南房総・木更津旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            犬吠埼（いぬぼうさき）が「山頂・離島を除き日本一早い日の出」と言われる理由は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 関東平野の最東端に位置し、元旦の初日の出（午前6時46分頃）をはじめ、年間を通じて日本本土で最も早く太陽が昇る絶景スポットだからです。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            成田山新勝寺の参拝と名物「うなぎ」の楽しみ方は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 表参道には『川豊』『駿河屋』など江戸時代から続く老舗うなぎ店が軒を連ね、参道に漂う香ばしいタレの香りとふっくら焼き上げた鰻重が絶品です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            東洋のドーバー「屏風ヶ浦（びょうぶがうら）」の見どころは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 銚子市名洗町から刑部岬まで約10kmにわたって続く高さ40〜50mの海食崖で、国の名勝・天然記念物に指定された雄大な断崖絶壁です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！千葉県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 千葉県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kanto-chiba-isobi-lobster-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】千葉・南房総 伊勢海老お造り＆鮑の踊り焼き・太平洋オーシャンビュー温泉旅館特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">館山・南房総</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kanto-chiba-kamogawa-seafood-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:tex